{
  "title": "Nutty Norwegian egg yolks Stir-fry",
  "description": "A light and earthy Norwegian dish featuring egg yolks and stir-fry, perfect for a gluten-free friendly meal. This dish is made with simple ingredients and can be prepared in no time.",
  "cuisine": "Norwegian",
